================================================================================
WHY AGPL
================================================================================

CelineEngine is compiled into Céline, which is built on JUCE under its free
licence and so is AGPLv3. The circuit simulator it runs on is under the same
terms.

This repository is public for the same reason the plugins are: anyone given a
binary is entitled to the corresponding source for that exact build. Each plugin
pins the CelineEngine commit it was built against, and each release is built from a
tagged commit of the plugin, so the source of a release is always reachable.


================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
================================================================================

The code here is built against JUCE (AGPLv3, (C) Raw Material Software Limited)
but does not bundle it.

The device equations follow SPICE (Berkeley, BSD-licensed) and the published
valve models of Norman Koren and of Dempwolf and Zölzer (DAFx-11); the
parameters are fitted here to manufacturers' datasheets, which each model's
header comment names. Equations and fitted numbers are facts, not copied code.
